CFG6G rho=2.80e-08 ohm*m t_Al=100 nm w_finger=0.6776 um N_pairs=12 r_finger=4.1322e+05 ohm/m (413.2 ohm/mm) source R0=50 ohm; bus bars ideal
CFG6G I_pi = pi*|Y|/(k0*|tot|) holds for both lumped and distributed (integral of V dz = I/Y); P_in = Re(Z_in)*|I_pi|^2/2; lossless L-match => P_source = P_in
CFG6G lumped: R_s = 2*rho*L/(w*t)/12 (hot + ground, full finger length, as specified); distributed: opposite-end-fed RC line, Z_in = (r/g)coth(gL/2) + rL/2, g = sqrt(2 r Y), r = r_finger/12
